# Build artifacts
native/build/
native/build-msvc/
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
*.vcxproj*
*.sln
.vs/
# Compiler object files (a stray MSVC .obj in the repo root showed up as untracked)
*.obj
*.o

# Secrets — never commit real credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Key material by name. The test-only certificates and keys under native/tests/fixtures are tracked on purpose
# (no production or demo code references them); anything else with these names must never be committed.
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets.*
!native/tests/fixtures/*.pem

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/

# TLA+ tooling (downloaded, not vendored — see formal/README.md) + TLC output
formal/tools/
formal/states/
*.dump.dot

# py_core backtest CLI run output (py_core/backtests/cli.py's default .var/backtests/<run_id>
# and .var/risk-aware-backtests/<run_id> artifact dirs)
py_core/.var/

# Local-only AI client rules & workspace state — not part of the shared repo
.claude/
Full Repo Audit Prompt.md
